+    """ALIGN ROW-RULE AND SIMULTANEOUS BLOCK-COLLISION CHECK.
+
+    Read the name literally. It was narrowed from "slot ownership":
+    with the production row rule ``row_used == req_idx``, so the
+    destination comparison below reduces to ``table[req_idx][dst_col]``
+    against itself and is TAUTOLOGICAL on a healthy run. This function derives
+    what it expects and what it observes from THE SAME TABLE, and a table
+    cannot testify about its own staleness. What it does and does not
+    establish, stated so that zero findings are not over-read:
