+    1. **Row attribution.** The row the kernel will use is the request's own
+       state slot. This is the property vllm#55506 violates: under PP the
+       deferred launch carries an ``idx_mapping`` captured ``pp_size`` steps
+       earlier, so ``batch_idx`` names a different request. The
+       ``BT_ROW_IS_REQ=False`` control exercises exactly this and nothing
+       wider.
+    2. **Simultaneous block collision.** Within ONE step, no two live request
